コットの猫ちゃんだけは必須でお願いします。\n（位置は資料に依存せずに自由に配置して頂いて構いません。）\nその他、構図やポーズはお任せで構いませんが、せっかくソナ様にお願いさせて頂くので何か猫月みおさんから連想出来るお花もどこかに添えて頂けると嬉しいです！\n\n〇要望\n・宛名・背景のオンオフができると嬉しいです（キャラ単体の透過差分）\n・もし可能であれば本人のVtuber活動（配信サムネイルやSNSでの告知など）での使用許可をいただきたいです。承諾いただける場合は宛名の○○さんへの横に星のマークを添えていだけると幸いです", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 63555, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "星井やな🌟日曜日 東1ホール キ62b", "screen_name": "posiiyana", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2077362424303460352/0iT--Qyh.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/861106354525675520/1752826556/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 15, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 923331, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "叶井柚葉", "screen_name": "kanayuzu611", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2002006643366924289/BptPhGyP.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1344933874447515649/1675245737/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 45, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 128}, {"id": 1225687, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "MofuMimi✨", "screen_name": "Kw9c8Y", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951092449616732161/2bwQSyKK.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/837433296682278912/1679790944/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requ